      "content": "Wait, I think you misunderstood. I'm looking for ways for my student (the PRO side) to defend themselves, but you're giving me ways to argue *for* UBI. \n\nWhat I actually need is for you to help them prepare for when the opposition hits them hard. Give me the strongest, most realistic arguments against UBI—the kind that actually win debates—and then show me how they can dismantle those specific points. I need to see the real flaws in the UBI logic.",
